[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12601.11, "timestamp": "03:30:01", "text": "我今天很恐慌，因为我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12603.91, "timestamp": "03:30:03", "text": "物理考试。大概有20页。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12607.349, "timestamp": "03:30:07", "text": "啊。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12609.83, "timestamp": "03:30:09", "text": "啊。如果你不这样做，就会发生这种情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12612.79, "timestamp": "03:30:12", "text": "按时完成作业。是疼痛。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12615.75, "timestamp": "03:30:15", "text": "我懂这种感觉。我能感觉到。感觉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12617.91, "timestamp": "03:30:17", "text": "因为我做了同样的事情，所以感到很痛苦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12622.229, "timestamp": "03:30:22", "text": "我的作业也需要用到。那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12625.429, "timestamp": "03:30:25", "text": "那一周的12小时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12632.55, "timestamp": "03:30:32", "text": "我能体会你的痛苦。但请坚持下去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12641.51, "timestamp": "03:30:41", "text": "20页可不是闹着玩的。那就是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12644.71, "timestamp": "03:30:44", "text": "很多。那可真不少。很多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12652.309, "timestamp": "03:30:52", "text": "[音乐]"}]